{"type":"route","meta":{"status":200,"headers":{"cache-control":"public, max-age=3600, s-maxage=86400","content-type":"application/json","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/api/layout,_N_T_/api/public/layout,_N_T_/api/public/mubxai/layout,_N_T_/api/public/mubxai/route,_N_T_/api/public/mubxai"}},"body":"{\"schema_version\":\"1.0\",\"last_updated\":\"2026-10-30\",\"entity\":{\"name\":\"MUBXAI\",\"alternate_names\":[\"MUBX AI\",\"HTUAI\",\"HTU AI\",\"MUBX Academic Tracker\"],\"type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"application_category\":\"EducationalApplication\",\"url\":\"https://ai.mubx.dev\",\"description\":\"MUBXAI is a free GPA calculator and academic tracker for Al Hussein Technical University (HTU) students in Jordan. Track courses, calculate CGPA, check prerequisites and plan your degree from 0 to graduation.\",\"price\":\"0\",\"currency\":\"USD\",\"languages\":[\"en\"],\"official\":false,\"operated_by\":\"MUBX (independent studio)\",\"studio\":\"https://mubx.dev\",\"founder\":\"https://me.mubx.dev\"},\"audience\":{\"students_at\":{\"name\":\"Al Hussein Technical University\",\"alternate_name\":\"HTU\",\"url\":\"https://htu.edu.jo\",\"location\":\"Amman, Jordan\"},\"level\":\"undergraduate\"},\"grading\":{\"scale\":\"HTU 4-point scale\",\"grades\":[{\"grade\":\"D\",\"label\":\"Distinction\",\"points\":4},{\"grade\":\"M\",\"label\":\"Merit\",\"points\":3.2},{\"grade\":\"P\",\"label\":\"Pass\",\"points\":2.4},{\"grade\":\"U\",\"label\":\"Unclassified\",\"points\":0}],\"formula\":\"GPA = sum(grade_points * credit_hours) / sum(graded_credit_hours)\",\"notes\":\"In-progress and planned courses are excluded from GPA until a grade is entered.\"},\"features\":[\"Course completion tracking\",\"GPA and CGPA calculation on the HTU 4-point scale\",\"Prerequisite checking\",\"Semester planning and grade prediction\",\"Degree progress by requirement category\",\"Study session logging with streaks and XP\",\"Google Calendar sync for exams and study sessions\"],\"majors\":[{\"key\":\"data_science\",\"name\":\"Data Science & AI\",\"school\":\"Computing\",\"description\":\"Machine Learning, Analytics, and Artificial Intelligence\",\"url\":\"https://ai.mubx.dev/majors/data-science\"},{\"key\":\"computer_science\",\"name\":\"Computer Science\",\"school\":\"Computing\",\"description\":\"Software Engineering, Algorithms, and Systems\",\"url\":\"https://ai.mubx.dev/majors/computer-science\"},{\"key\":\"cybersecurity\",\"name\":\"Cybersecurity\",\"school\":\"Computing\",\"description\":\"Network Security, Ethical Hacking, and Cryptography\",\"url\":\"https://ai.mubx.dev/majors/cybersecurity\"},{\"key\":\"game_design\",\"name\":\"Game Design\",\"school\":\"Computing\",\"description\":\"Game Mechanics, Graphics, and Interactive Design\",\"url\":\"https://ai.mubx.dev/majors/game-design\"},{\"key\":\"electrical_engineering\",\"name\":\"Electrical Engineering\",\"school\":\"Engineering\",\"description\":\"Power Systems, Electronics, and Control Systems\",\"url\":\"https://ai.mubx.dev/majors/electrical-engineering\"},{\"key\":\"energy_engineering\",\"name\":\"Energy Engineering\",\"school\":\"Engineering\",\"description\":\"Renewable Energy, Power Generation, and Sustainability\",\"url\":\"https://ai.mubx.dev/majors/energy-engineering\"},{\"key\":\"industrial_engineering\",\"name\":\"Industrial Engineering\",\"school\":\"Engineering\",\"description\":\"Optimization, Logistics, and Manufacturing Systems\",\"url\":\"https://ai.mubx.dev/majors/industrial-engineering\"},{\"key\":\"mechanical_engineering\",\"name\":\"Mechanical Engineering\",\"school\":\"Engineering\",\"description\":\"Thermodynamics, Robotics, and Machine Design\",\"url\":\"https://ai.mubx.dev/majors/mechanical-engineering\"}],\"pages\":{\"home\":\"https://ai.mubx.dev\",\"gpa_calculator\":\"https://ai.mubx.dev/gpa-calculator\",\"courses\":\"https://ai.mubx.dev/courses\",\"majors\":\"https://ai.mubx.dev/majors\",\"how_it_works\":\"https://ai.mubx.dev/how-it-works\",\"faq\":\"https://ai.mubx.dev/faq\",\"about\":\"https://ai.mubx.dev/about\",\"ai_transparency\":\"https://ai.mubx.dev/ai-transparency\",\"privacy\":\"https://ai.mubx.dev/privacy\",\"terms\":\"https://ai.mubx.dev/terms\",\"llms_txt\":\"https://ai.mubx.dev/llms.txt\",\"ai_txt\":\"https://ai.mubx.dev/ai.txt\",\"sitemap\":\"https://ai.mubx.dev/sitemap.xml\"},\"faq\":[{\"question\":\"What is MUBXAI?\",\"answer\":\"MUBXAI (also written MUBX AI) is a free academic tracker and GPA calculator for students at Al Hussein Technical University (HTU) in Amman, Jordan. It tracks completed courses, calculates GPA and CGPA on the HTU 4.0 scale, checks prerequisites, plans semesters and monitors degree progress.\"},{\"question\":\"Is MUBXAI the same as HTUAI?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. The product was originally called HTUAI and was renamed MUBXAI. Both names refer to the same free academic tracker at ai.mubx.dev.\"},{\"question\":\"Is MUBXAI an official HTU tool?\",\"answer\":\"No. MUBXAI is an independent student-built tool created by Omar Mubaidin and maintained by MUBX. It is not operated or endorsed by Al Hussein Technical University. Always cross-check official results with HTU academic records.\"},{\"question\":\"How does the HTU GPA calculator work?\",\"answer\":\"MUBXAI uses the HTU 4-point scale: D = 4.0, M = 3.2, P = 2.4 and U = 0.0. GPA is the sum of grade points multiplied by credit hours, divided by completed credit hours. In-progress and planned courses are excluded until a grade is entered.\"},{\"question\":\"Is MUBXAI free?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. MUBXAI is 100% free. There are no premium tiers, subscriptions, ads or hidden fees.\"},{\"question\":\"Which majors does MUBXAI support?\",\"answer\":\"MUBXAI supports the HTU curricula for Computer Science, Data Science and AI, Cybersecurity, Game Design, Electrical Engineering, Energy Engineering, Industrial Engineering and Mechanical Engineering.\"},{\"question\":\"Does MUBXAI sync with Google Calendar?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. After you connect Google Calendar, MUBXAI can push exam dates and study sessions to your calendar. It only writes the events you choose and does not read unrelated calendar data.\"}],\"disclaimers\":[\"MUBXAI is not an official Al Hussein Technical University product and is not endorsed by the university.\",\"MUBXAI is a planning aid. Official GPA, credit and graduation status must be confirmed with HTU.\",\"Authenticated user data is private and is not part of this endpoint.\"]}"}